<title>USA: SoCalEdison to pilot Itron technology.</title>
<headline>SoCalEdison to pilot Itron technology.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMEAD, Calif. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southern California Edison said it signed a letter of intent for Itron Inc to develop a $12-million pilot program to read 50,000 meters in the utility's service territory using Itron's Fixed Network Automatic Meter Reading technology.</p>
<p>The pilot will allow the Edison International subsidiary to evaluate the potential use of the technology utility-wide, it said.</p>
<p>Metering and system integration in support of the pilot will be provided by ABB Group's ABB Power T&amp;D Co subsidiary, Edison said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
